@startuml
title "As a Buyer, I want to use the Web UI to list items on sale of a given publication %n()(direct sales and auctions)." SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

' --- Actor and participants ---
actor Buyer
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

' --- System dialog ---

Buyer -> System: Opens marketplace
activate System
System --> Buyer: Displays active direct sales and auctions
deactivate System

Buyer -> System: Selects a publication in the multi-select filter
activate System
System --> Buyer: Displays matching active sales and auctions of the selected publication
deactivate System

@enduml